---
// Generic not-found page. GitHub Pages serves /404.html for any unresolved
// path, so this is the fallback for a shared /s/<id> whose scenario is not in
// the curated gallery (e.g. a user-authored scenario). It cannot know the
// visitor's locale (served for arbitrary paths), so it is bilingual with an
// English shell (#1071, Growth A-2). The App Store badge links to the live
// App Store listing via the site's shared .appstore-cta styling.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Not found · Pastura"
  description="This page isn’t available. Pastura is an app for running AI multi-agent scenarios fully on-device."
  enPath="/404.html"
  jaPath="/404.html"
  variant="prose"
>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

  <div class="page-shell">
    <header role="banner" class="lp-header">
      <a href="/" class="brand">
        <img class="icon" src="/img/app-icon.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="36" height="36" />
        <span class="brand-name">Pastura</span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <main id="main" class="page-main">
      <div class="page-prose">
        <h1>Page not found</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          This scenario or page isn’t available here. It may not be part of
          Pastura’s Shared Scenarios.
        </p>
        <p lang="ja">
          このシナリオ、またはページは見つかりませんでした。Pastura の「みんなのシナリオ」に含まれていない可能性があります。
        </p>

        <p class="open-cta-row">
          <a class="open-cta" href="/">Go to pastura.app</a>
        </p>

        <div class="badges">
          <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/pastura-local-llms-simulator/id6788409688" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="appstore-cta" aria-label="Pastura on the App Store / Pastura を App Store で">
            <img class="appstore-img" src="/img/app-store-badge-en.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="120" height="40" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer role="contentinfo" class="lp-footer">
      <div class="foot-base">
        <span class="foot-copy">© 2026 Pastura</span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .open-cta-row {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .open-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--moss, #4f6d3a);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .open-cta:hover,
  .open-cta:focus-visible {
    background: var(--moss-dark, #3d5a2b);
  }
</style>
